Logged in to the jenkins with arpit user , password as admin
Installed RBAC plugin named ROLE BASED AUTHORISATION STRATEGY, restart jenkins.
Go to Manage jenkins > Security > Authorization > select from drop down "Project based matrix authorization strategy".
Now a new option under MANAGE JENKINS will appear as "MANAGE AND ASSIGN ROLES"
Now Create a jenkins freestyle job 
  - add git repo of any java app
  -  add creds if private repo
  -  Select POLL SCM for triggers
  -  add * * * * * for everymin build trigger whenever there is change in the git repo.
  -  check who run the build by going into build details and on top it is written "Started by an SCM change"
  
